      "start_seconds": 81.85,
      "end_seconds": 107.56,
      "duration_seconds": 25.71,
      "text": "it usually comes with a tremor in my right hand at rest the, The tremor in my right hand at rest? That's been for about a week about tremor in my right hand at rest, mild, I'd say oh, and slowness"
