      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.06,
      "end_seconds": 292.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "There is a pill-rolling tremor at rest on the right and the arm is stiff with a cogwheel feel."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.61,
      "end_seconds": 320.48,
      "duration_seconds": 25.87,
      "text": "Alright, thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards possible Parkinson's disease. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a drug-induced tremor yet. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had smaller handwriting for ten days, and no constipation or memory problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.74,
      "end_seconds": 324.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "well, that's what happened, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.47,
      "end_seconds": 341.05,
      "duration_seconds": 14.58,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Okay, today I'm not changing anything. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
